{%- comment -%}
  Compact PayFac recurring-subscription disclosure.
  ==================================================
  Shared by sections/eyewipes-offer-page.liquid and
  sections/freshwipes-offer-page.liquid. Rendered once beside every purchase
  button that can submit the RoutineCare cart directly (the hero Add to Cart
  button and the bottom-of-page "final offer" button; NOT the anchors that only
  scroll back to the hero, and NOT the sticky bar, which is a shortcut for the
  hero button rather than an independent purchase path).

  This snippet never computes a price, a selling plan or a currency. The two
  amount placeholders are filled in — and the whole block shown or hidden — by
  the page's own JS, from the exact same Kaching-rendered price string the
  sticky bar already uses. See "PAYFAC DISCLOSURE" in the page's .js file.

  Params:
    frequency  — required. Real billing-interval text for the RoutineCare
                 selling plan (a section setting, not hardcoded here).
    manage_url — required. "Manage subscription" link target.
{%- endcomment -%}

<p class="pfd-disclosure" data-pfd-disclosure>
  RoutineCare subscription. <span data-pfd-today>&nbsp;</span> charged today, then <span data-pfd-recurring>&nbsp;</span> every {{ frequency }} until cancelled. No trial. Cancel anytime: <a href="{{ manage_url }}" class="pfd-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Manage subscription</a>.
</p>
